  "claims": [
    {
      "id": "claim_1e087483ed7d4f6789eaef708ca65bca",
      "statement": "New pull requests are opened through the open_pull_request tool (not shell gh pr create), which requires the branch to already be pushed to origin, takes owner/repo/head/base/title/body, and returns a result whose created flag distinguishes a newly opened PR from an already-existing one.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://agent/tools/open_pull_request.py#L824-L866",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:a7b65625579aa12ca9b6cbecff28201b92d9920126b72af29729549bea1b7ce6:"
        },
        {
          "resource": "repo://agent/tools/open_pull_request.py#L898-L943",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:96c8e0113016335532be274b23b46b132d807145228e485444836c90f985c2f0:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_f263bf43bb7544f0afa00798b2c201fd",
      "statement": "open_pull_request attributes the PR to the triggering user: _resolve_pr_author_token prefers the user's OAuth token resolved fresh by GitHub login (for slack/linear/dashboard sources) so the PR is authored as that person, and falls back to the GitHub App installation token (open-swe[bot]) for GitHub-triggered runs, unmapped users, or bot-only deployments.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://agent/tools/open_pull_request.py#L46-L71",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:1471b459273a16fd334ea9301438caf1b1148a22dcd3566dc2379210940f6822:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_517d178b29504b6c9835717912b0e1f1",
      "statement": "Before creating a PR, open_pull_request runs a preflight that GETs the repository and the base and head branches, returning specific failure codes (github_app_access_missing_or_repo_not_found, github_pr_branch_not_visible, github_pr_preflight_failed) with a summary of GitHub's actual status, selected headers, and truncated body instead of an opaque error.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://agent/tools/open_pull_request.py#L29-L31",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:b052dc227044e7e664df4bac9ad4bbc871c70ff08d8b454a28b3e7524b744330:"
