      "statement": "open_pull_request appends a ## References section to the PR body with the dashboard plan link and source references (Slack thread permalink, Linear ticket, or GitHub issue), but only adds originating-source references when GitHub confirms the target repository is private, preventing private conversation links from leaking into public PRs.",
