    {
      "id": "claim_07dd7cd9be1542d8b60432b674f22e85",
      "statement": "On success open_pull_request records PR telemetry: it fetches full PR details, calls record_agent_pr_usage, and upserts a normalized PR record (URL, number, state via derive_pr_state, head/base refs, author, diff stats) into the thread's pull_requests metadata, and for Slack code-channel sessions refreshes the channel context bar and diff view.",
