      "statement": "The dashboard PR status surface computes live health per tracked PR record — live state (open/closed/merged), draft flag, merge-conflict state from mergeable/mergeable_state, failing checks with links, and pending/inconclusive counts plus unresolved GraphQL review threads — and guards every field behind availability flags (statusAvailable, checksAvailable, commentsAvailable) so a missing permission or transient error degrades to unavailable rather than erroring.",
